.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Startet Einzelverarbeitung fÅr alle markierten Zeilen
.. Functionality  : Starts single-transaction processing for all marked rows
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
..  process rows that have a marked checbox 'tbmark'
..  process rows with single-activation efop
..
.select screen header
!ROW
.select screen line
.continue END     ? _T|mehr
.continue ROW     ? _M|tbmark
.input "atlas/ATLASEXPORT.TBUEXPORT.BN"
.continue ROW
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
